[[File:Kath Hound.jpg|thumb|240x240px]]

Kath Hounds are [[Beasts]] native to the planet [[Dantooine]]. They stand about 1 meter tall, with four legs and razor-sharp teeth. One breed also sports impressive horns, (The [[Horned Kath Hound]]) flanking it's head on three sides. The hounds are dangerous to the unprepared. Occasionally, crime lords in [[The Exchange]] keep them as pets, or for use as primitive guardians.

